      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WAVY WEB SURF (3) hit the ground running and set it up early clocking 23.64 with a half a length win at this track over 411m. Expected to be right there at the finish again. BURRINGBAR REBEL (2) produced a modest effort most recently when eighth at Capalaba over 366m behind Spartan (20.20) in a Grade 5. Was in the money the start prior. The form out of his last race has been franked. Should play a prominent role. BARLEY CHARLIE (8) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start seventh (20.26) at Grafton. Has a good record here including four wins. Expected to run well. HOOTIN' ANGEL (1) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance – sure to have admirers.",
